Source: nvmesh-kernel
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Maintainer: NVIDIA Corporation <linux-kernel@nvidia.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13)
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: nvmesh-client-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, python3 (>= 3.8), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Description: NVMesh client kernel modules (DKMS)
 Provides the NVMesh client kernel modules, built via DKMS for the
 running kernel. Installs the following modules:
  - nvmeibc  (NVMesh IB client block driver)
  - nvmeiba  (NVMesh IB client atom driver)
  - nvmeib_common (NVMesh IB common)
  - nvmeib_keeper (NVMesh IB keeper)
  - nvmeib_common_public (NVMesh IB public common)
  - nvmeib_common_mlx5_public (NVMesh MLX5 public)
  - nvmeib_common_mlx4_public (NVMesh MLX4 public, when OFED < 5.1)

Package: nvmesh-target-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: dkms, python3 (>= 3.8), ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: linux-headers-generic
Description: NVMesh target kernel modules (DKMS)
 Provides the NVMesh target kernel modules, built via DKMS for the
 running kernel. Installs the following modules:
  - nvmeibs  (NVMesh IB server/target driver)
  - nvmeib_common (NVMesh IB common)
  - nvmeib_keeper (NVMesh IB keeper)
  - nvmeib_common_public (NVMesh IB public common)
  - nvmeib_common_mlx5_public (NVMesh MLX5 public)
  - nvmeib_common_mlx4_public (NVMesh MLX4 public, when OFED < 5.1)
